    "recommendations": {
      "statement": "Each area also has a free-text recommended-configuration field (greTunnelRecommendedConfiguration, pacFileRecommendedConfiguration, authFrequencyRecommendedConfiguration, pacFileSizeRecommendedConfiguration, office365RecommendedConfiguration, ipVisibilityRecommendedConfiguration); the response also has office365Flag, dataPresent, reportTimestamp and an authFrequency object with authFrequency and authCustomFrequency.",
